    "intro_narrative": "You are a private investigator hired to look into a high-profile disappearance. You've managed to break into the suspect's abandoned hideout, a dusty room filled with strange investigative equipment and locked containers. The air is heavy with suspense, and you can hear distant sirens echoing through the city streets. The police are on their way, giving you only a short window of time to piece together the scattered evidence left behind. Your ultimate goal is to obtain the final piece of evidence hidden somewhere in this room. To do so, you must carefully analyze everything you find. You will need to trace routes on digital maps, extract data from damaged devices, and feed your findings through a complex network of forensic tools. Each piece of equipment relies on data processed by another, forming a web of clues that you must unravel. Stay sharp, follow the trail of data, and uncover the truth before time runs out.",
